WEBVTT

30:03.161 --> 30:04.412
I have to take care of him.

30:04.537 --> 30:06.247
He's not going to die, Mother.

30:06.373 --> 30:08.166
Maester Luwin says the most
dangerous time has passed.

30:08.291 --> 30:09.334
What if he's wrong?

30:09.459 --> 30:12.879
- Bran needs me.
- Rickon needs you.

30:13.880 --> 30:15.715
- He's six.
- (BARKING AND HOWLING CONTINUES)

30:15.840 --> 30:19.052
He doesn't know what's happening.
He follows me around all day,

30:19.177 --> 30:21.471
- clutching my leg, crying...
- Close the windows!

30:21.596 --> 30:23.598
I can't stand it!
Please make them stop!

30:23.723 --> 30:26.810
- (HOWLING, BARKING)
- (ANIMAL SHRIEKING)

30:27.519 --> 30:28.978
Fire.
